  "summary_en": "UK statutory instrument made under the EU Withdrawal Act 2018 that amends retained EU drone regulations 2019/945 and 2019/947 for post-Brexit use. It replaces CE marking with UK marking, notified bodies with approved bodies, EASA and Member State authorities with the CAA, and introduces designated standards.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Replaces CE marking with UK marking for unmanned aircraft systems",
   "Replaces notified bodies with Secretary of State-approved conformity assessment bodies and a public register",
   "Introduces British Standards Institution designated standards in place of EU harmonised standards",
   "Transfers competent authority functions from EASA and Member States to the UK CAA",
   "Allows continued recognition of CE-marked UAS until designated standards exist"
  ],
